<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-INDIA 168 ALL OUT IN 43.5 OVERS V ZIMBABWE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 168 ALL OUT IN 43.5 OVERS V ZIMBABWE.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were all out for 168 off 43.5 overs in the first one-day international against Zimbabwe at Queens Sports Club on Saturday.</p>
